 or lower; Perform at DC 28 or lower","maximumPerRound":5},"createMagicItems":{"scope":"any magic instrument or artistic item","maximumMarketPriceGp":30000},"avatarStatus":"No Avatar salient divine ability is present in the printed stat block; no avatar stat block is created.","revision3_5":{"alignmentSubtypes":["good"],"damageReduction":"20/epic","fireResistance":13,"additionalOutsiderSkillPoints":true,"bard":{"inspireCourage":"Revised bard 20 inspire courage bonus applies.","newMusicEffects":["song of freedom","inspire heroics","mass suggestion"],"additionalSkillPoints":40},"divineSkillFocus":"Apply revised skill-focus/divine skill-focus interaction under the official update.","defunctSkills":["Animal Empathy -> wild empathy","Scry ranks reassigned"]}}'),

('dd-statblock-imhotep','Imhotep Divine Stat Block','147-148',
